  _enText: After activating backup, your base becomes invulnerable for a while!
  _trText: "Yard\u0131mlar\u0131 etkinle\u015Ftirdikten sonra, \xFCss\xFCn\xFCz bir
    s\xFCre yenilmez hale gelir!"
